# Plaintext demo credentials and a captured session cookie. They were
# untracked but NOT ignored, so any `git add .` would have committed them --
# and a credential in git history can't be un-shipped.
# Local pg_dump output, made when moving the database between machines.
# 235MB -- over GitHub's 100MB hard limit, so committing it doesn't just
# bloat the repo, it wedges the next push.
/vahan.dump

